This talent allows you to prepare up to [1, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] different trap(s) of tier [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] or less for later deployment. (Use this ability to select which to prepare.)

Designs known:

Traps prepared this way are difficult to detect ([38, 52, 61, 68, 75 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] detection 'power') and disarm ([47, 65, 77, 86, 93 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] disarm 'power') based on your Cunning.  They gain [+25%, +50%, +69%, +85%, +100% (TL1-5)] effectiveness, and can be deployed without breaking stealth [62%, 75%, 84%, 92%, 100% (TL1-5; CUN 100)] of the time.

You are immune to the damage and negative effects of your traps, and traps may critically strike based on your physical crit chance.

Most traps last [9, 10, 11, 12, 13 (TL1-5)] turns if not triggered, and refund 80% of their stamina cost on expiration.

More designs may be discovered via disarming or learned from special instructors in the world.
